            <properties>
              <foreground color="-8355712"/>
              <opaque value="true"/>
              <text value="&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;Time travel debug supports some forward and backward debug actions in time travel debug mode.&lt;br&gt; In time travel debug mode, you can only check the debug information you have visited in previous debug process.&lt;br&gt; Debug Information including: threads, stacks, variables.&lt;br&gt; Modifying breakpoints, watch view and hover are not supported in time travel debug mode. &lt;br&gt;If you modified breakpoints, it will become available after you close the time travel debug mode.&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;"/>
